{"id":"f166196d1a923b7c","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-df-shelly.md","title":"Shelah's Strong Hypothesis","display":"df-shelly — Shelah's Strong Hypothesis","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-shelly","aliases":["58-df-shelly","Shelah's Strong Hypothesis"],"display":"df-shelly — Shelah's Strong Hypothesis","depends_on":["[[58-df-pcf]]","[[58-df-cardinal]]","[[58-df-cofinality]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-shelly"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-shelly</span><span>Shelah's Strong Hypothesis</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-shelly — Shelah's Strong Hypothesis"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b82cea6742372d50\" href=\"?note=b82cea6742372d50\" title=\"58-df-pcf\">58-df-pcf</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"315ad00b8744fdfc\" href=\"?note=315ad00b8744fdfc\" title=\"58-df-cofinality\">58-df-cofinality</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Explicit relation signatures used below: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\subseteq V^{1}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\subseteq V^{1}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SSHAt}_S\\subseteq V^{1}\">\\(\\mathrm{SSHAt}_S\\subseteq V^{1}\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span> (candidate singular cardinal) and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda^+\">\\(\\lambda^+\\)</span> (its successor cardinal)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{pp}(\\lambda)\">\\(\\mathrm{pp}(\\lambda)\\)</span> (pcf of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cf}\">\\(\\mathrm{cf}\\)</span> (cardinal and cofinality predicates)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SSHAt}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{SSHAt}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SSH}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{SSH}_S\\)</span> (local and global SSH predicates defined here)</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}shelly\\text{-}local} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{SSHAt}_S(\\lambda)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\\mathrm{cf}(\\lambda)&lt;\\lambda\\land\\mathrm{pp}(\\lambda)=\\lambda^+\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}shelly\\text{-}local} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{SSHAt}_S(\\lambda)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\\mathrm{cf}(\\lambda)&lt;\\lambda\\land\\mathrm{pp}(\\lambda)=\\lambda^+\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}shelly\\text{-}global} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{SSH}_S\\leftrightarrow\\forall\\lambda\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\\mathrm{cf}(\\lambda)&lt;\\lambda\\to\\mathrm{SSHAt}_S(\\lambda)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}shelly\\text{-}global} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{SSH}_S\\leftrightarrow\\forall\\lambda\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\\mathrm{cf}(\\lambda)&lt;\\lambda\\to\\mathrm{SSHAt}_S(\\lambda)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Shelah's Strong Hypothesis (SSH): refined version of GCH at singular cardinals</li>\n<li>pcfs (possible cofinalities): <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{pcf}(\\lambda)\">\\(\\mathrm{pcf}(\\lambda)\\)</span> explains cardinal arithmetic at singular points</li>\n<li>SSH implies <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^\\lambda=\\lambda^+\">\\(2^\\lambda=\\lambda^+\\)</span> for strong-limit singular <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span>; this implication is a theorem and is not conjoined to the definition.</li>\n<li>Consistency: SSH is consistent relative to large cardinals (ZFC + measurable)</li>\n<li>Relation to GCH: SSH <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Rightarrow\">\\(\\Rightarrow\\)</span> GCH at appropriate cardinals; strictly weaker assumption</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Shelah, Cardinal Arithmetic</li>\n<li>Shelah, The Future of Set Theory</li>\n<li>Abraham and Magidor, Cardinal Arithmetic</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-pcf","status":"resolved","id":"b82cea6742372d50","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-pcf]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-cardinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cofinality","status":"resolved","id":"315ad00b8744fdfc","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-cofinality]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\subseteq V^{1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SSHAt}_S\\subseteq V^{1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda^+","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{pp}(\\lambda)","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{cf}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SSHAt}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SSH}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}shelly\\text{-}local} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{SSHAt}_S(\\lambda)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\\mathrm{cf}(\\lambda)<\\lambda\\land\\mathrm{pp}(\\lambda)=\\lambda^+","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}shelly\\text{-}global} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{SSH}_S\\leftrightarrow\\forall\\lambda\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\\mathrm{cf}(\\lambda)<\\lambda\\to\\mathrm{SSHAt}_S(\\lambda)\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{pcf}(\\lambda)","display":false},{"tex":"2^\\lambda=\\lambda^+","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda","display":false},{"tex":"\\Rightarrow","display":false}],"bytes":1821,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1153","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-shelly.md|58-df-shelly]]（batch19）"}],"outgoing":["b82cea6742372d50","5fb1c2241d1943d1","315ad00b8744fdfc"]}